      ],
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rPocXBzbet8DhzFGYU1cX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -588.8098575001163,
      "y": -3389.4441206203282,
      "width": 788.0594482421875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "9yEdspgF6X0dJ8A7irOZS"
      ],
      "frameId": "F6YdtZKFY5KSyW9VLf-hw",
      "index": "a0zv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 821221925,
      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 1902575365,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784686000034,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NCCL (NVIDIA Collective Communications Library, pronounced \"nickel\") is to multi-\nGPU programming what cuBLAS is to matrix multiplication: a highly optimized\nlibrary that handles the hard parts for you.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NCCL (NVIDIA Collective Communications Library, pronounced \"nickel\") is to multi-GPU programming what cuBLAS is to matrix multiplication: a highly optimized library that handles the hard parts for you.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M57Oqih-NGo_UAs7142xj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -591.7885114733629,
      "y": -3279.2188963196913,
      "width": 728.6995239257812,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "9yEdspgF6X0dJ8A7irOZS"
      ],
      "frameId": "F6YdtZKFY5KSyW9VLf-hw",
      "index": "a0zw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 802883243,
      "version": 176,
      "versionNonce": 10147429,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784686000034,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NCCL provides collective operations that work across multiple GPUs, called\n\"collective\" because all GPUs participate simultaneously.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NCCL provides collective operations that work across multiple GPUs, called \"collective\" because all GPUs participate simultaneously.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "If0Qaj04zZMQnw2QEPnqb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -587.1134136550065,
      "y": -3185.4707362108347,
      "width": 795.4595336914062,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "9yEdspgF6X0dJ8A7irOZS"
      ],
      "frameId": "F6YdtZKFY5KSyW9VLf-hw",
      "index": "a0zy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2114237989,
      "version": 154,
      "versionNonce": 1578942917,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784686000034,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The key insight about NCCL is topology awareness. When you call any collective\noperation, NCCL doesn’t just blindly send data around. It looks at your hardware\ntopology (which GPUs have NVLink, which don’t) and chooses the fastest route.\nOn a system with NVLink, NCCL will use ring or tree algorithms that maximize\nNVLink bandwidth. On systems without NVLink, it falls back to PCIe.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The key insight about NCCL is topology awareness. When you call any collective operation, NCCL doesn’t just blindly send data around. It looks at your hardware topology (which GPUs have NVLink, which don’t) and chooses the fastest route. On a system with NVLink, NCCL will use ring or tree algorithms that maximize NVLink bandwidth. On systems without NVLink, it falls back to PCIe.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5I3wFlYhV43gVgr7oqK8y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2076.5527076456037,
      "y": -521.1804312657007,
      "width": 759.739501953125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "uarwT_BgYpEGC6YGf2dsF"
      ],
      "frameId": "F6YdtZKFY5KSyW9VLf-hw",
      "index": "a0zzzztG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2048354507,
      "version": 105,
      "versionNonce": 1339701451,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784686005292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Latency: Requires 2(P-1) steps for AllReduce, where P is the number of GPUs",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Latency: Requires 2(P-1) steps for AllReduce, where P is the number of GPUs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QwNCsqbbs96tUm3Vm0glZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2089.5226478311506,
      "y": -593.6804312657007,
      "width": 785.6793823242188,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "oKDzmHVKqPSi7MT-er-UB",
        "uarwT_BgYpEGC6YGf2dsF"
      ],
      "frameId": "F6YdtZKFY5KSyW9VLf-hw",
      "index": "a0zzzztV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 683779589,
      "version": 266,
      "versionNonce": 1766778731,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784686005292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bandwidth optimal: All links active simultaneously, achieving aggregate bandwidth\nof P × link_bandwidth",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bandwidth optimal: All links active simultaneously, achieving aggregate bandwidth of P × link_bandwidth",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P0ddWkuF1V2QgdNgF1yvA",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 535.9458620181313,
      "y": -1247.7042181169459,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 497,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "oKDzmHVKqPSi7MT-er-UB",
        "uarwT_BgYpEGC6YGf2dsF"
      ],
      "frameId": "F6YdtZKFY5KSyW9VLf-hw",
